# Next.js Frontend

## Performance-first defaults

Every page decision starts with: **does this increase initial JS or delay LCP?** If yes, find a static/server alternative.

- **SSG** all marketing routes — `dynamic = 'force-static'`
- **Server Components by default** — `'use client'` only per allowlist in `performance.mdc`
- **No client fetch** on home, about, projects list, blog list — data imported at build time
- **Contact form** lives on `/contact` only; lazy-loaded via `dynamic()`
- Prefer **links** over embedded interactive widgets on landing sections

## Version & Conventions

- **Next.js 15** App Router, **TypeScript** strict
- Path alias: `@/` → `frontend/` root (or project convention after scaffold)
- **Server Components by default** — add `'use client'` only when required

## App Structure

```
frontend/app/
├── [locale]/
│   ├── layout.tsx          # fonts, providers, header/footer
│   ├── page.tsx            # home
│   ├── about/page.tsx
│   ├── projects/
│   │   ├── page.tsx
│   │   └── [slug]/page.tsx
│   ├── blog/
│   │   ├── page.tsx
│   │   └── [slug]/page.tsx
│   ├── contact/page.tsx
│   └── not-found.tsx
├── sitemap.ts
└── robots.ts
```

- All user-facing routes under `[locale]`
- Shared layout: Header (nav + locale + theme), Footer (social links)
- `not-found.tsx` localized via next-intl

## Components

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `components/ui/` | ShadCN primitives — Button, Card, Badge, Input, Textarea |
| `components/layout/` | Header, Footer, LocaleSwitcher, ThemeToggle, MobileNav |
| `components/sections/` | Hero, About, Skills, ProjectsGrid, ExperienceTimeline, Contact |
| `components/blog/` | PostCard, PostLayout, TableOfContents |

- Section components receive **typed props** from `content/data` — not inline magic strings
- Extract repeated patterns (SectionHeading, ExternalLink) — don't duplicate markup

## ShadCN + Tailwind

- Initialize ShadCN with **neutral/slate** base — professional, not playful
- Use `cn()` utility for conditional classes
- Design tokens in `globals.css` — CSS variables for light/dark themes
- No inline styles except dynamic values

## Styling Rules

- Mobile-first responsive: `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:` breakpoints
- Max content width: `max-w-5xl` or `max-w-6xl` centered — readable prose on About/Blog
- Section spacing consistent: e.g. `py-16 md:py-24`
- Project cards: hover state subtle (border/shadow), not aggressive scale transforms

## Links

```tsx
import Link from 'next/link';

// Internal
<Link href={`/${locale}/projects/${slug}`}>{title}</Link>

// External
<a href={url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{label}</a>
```

## MDX Integration

- `@next/mdx` or `next-mdx-remote` — pick one pattern project-wide
- MDX components map: `components/mdx/` — styled headings, code blocks, Callout
- Syntax highlighting: `rehype-pretty-code` or Shiki

## Error & Loading

- `loading.tsx` for blog list if fetch ever added — optional skeleton
- Contact form errors: inline field errors + toast optional
- `error.tsx` boundary for blog segment — friendly i18n message

## Env Usage

- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` — metadata, sitemap, OG URLs only
- Never expose API secrets in client components

## Testing Hooks (when added)

- Prefer Vitest + React Testing Library for utilities and critical form validation
- No test requirement for static presentational sections unless logic exists
